                                                        <p class="brfprofile"><b>Brief Profile:</b> Dr. Swati Gautam
                                                            possesses a Doctorate in Applied Business Economics
                                                            (Commerce) and has completed an M.Phil in the same
                                                            discipline with distinction. She also holds a Master of
                                                            Commerce (M.Com) degree with a specialization in
                                                            International Business, as well as a Bachelor of Commerce
                                                            (B.Com). Her UGC-NET qualification in Commerce further
                                                            validates her robust academic credentials.
                                                            <br>
                                                            She is presently associated with the GNIOT Institute of
                                                            Management Studies (GIMS), Greater Noida, as an Assistant
                                                            Professor in Finance. Her teaching interests include
                                                            Financial Accounting, Cost Accounting, Management
                                                            Accounting, Corporate Finance, and Financial Risk Management
                                                            and Measurement.
                                                            <br>
                                                            Dr. Gautam has a strong inclination towards research, with
                                                            over four years of experience in research. Her Ph.D.
                                                            research focused on analyzing start-up programs as a tool
                                                            for building entrepreneurial ecosystems in Western Uttar
                                                            Pradesh. She has presented several research papers at
                                                            prestigious national and international conferences &
                                                            seminars and has published multiple papers.
                                                            <br>
                                                            She has actively participated in various Faculty Development
                                                            Programmes (FDPs) and workshops related to research
                                                            methodology, quantitative analysis, and econometric
                                                            modeling, organized by premier institutions such as IIT
                                                            Roorkee, Amity University, and the University of Delhi.
                                                            <br>
                                                            As a committed academician, Dr. Swati Gautam brings a blend
                                                            of teaching excellence, research insight, and
                                                            student-centered learning practices. She continues to make
                                                            meaningful contributions to curriculum innovation, academic
                                                            development, and the improvement of learning outcomes in
                                                            higher education.
                                                        </p>
