                                                        <p class="facpara">
                                                            I follow a <strong>flipped classroom approach</strong>, encouraging students
                                                            to review learning materials in advance and actively
                                                            participate in classroom discussions, problem-solving
                                                            activities, and collaborative learning exercises. In
                                                            addition, I employ <strong>project-based learning</strong>, where students
                                                            work on industry-relevant financial projects, investment
                                                            analyses, and business valuation assignments.
